&lt;li&gt;Video interview with the Hiring Manager (45 mins)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In person code pairing interview with a member of Engineering team (1 hour)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video interview with the wider Liberis team&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(1 hour)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
