&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in at least one of .NET (C#), Node.js and Python — able to build, configure, and template production-grade services in each.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong GCP experience (Azure experience is nice to have)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience designing reusable CI/CD pipeline templates — GitHub Actions or Azure DevOps — consistent across stacks and teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with containerisation (Docker) and deployment on Kubernetes or Cloud Run.&lt;/li&gt;
