&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic AI &amp;amp; Generative AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with Agentic AI frameworks, LLM-driven reasoning, or autonomous planning agents to enhance conversational search and automated itinerary generation.&lt;/li&gt;
